{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53160","headline":"五言宿妙喜寺赠远公一首 · 陈羽","name":"五言宿妙喜寺赠远公一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空学西天客，冥然生意长。\n夏高云纳愁近坛凉（此联抄本原缺二字）。\n月半生空处，孤灯宿上方。\n欲离夕字想，何法御心王。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}